partcad-collection-openusd-disney-moana
=======================================

This PartCAD package serves the Moana Island Scene as PartCAD parts.

The code in this repository (the `moana_repo.py` repository plugin, the shared
`usd_assets.py`, the PartCAD configuration and the tests) is:

