No asset is included in this repository. The assets, their layers and their
textures are fetched on demand from https://datasets.disneyanimation.com,
and remain Disney Enterprises, Inc.'s, under the License for Moana Island Scene
(https://media.disneyanimation.com/uploads/production/data_set_asset/4/asset/License.txt):
for research and software development only. Nothing is fetched until the user
has allowed the plugin to read the archive.

The seek index of the archive, island-usd-v2.1.index.xz, holds 67 pieces of
32 KB of the scene's USD layers - the data just before each place a read of the
archive may begin. They are redistributed under the License for Moana Island
Scene, whose copyright notice, conditions and disclaimer are reproduced in full
in island-usd-v2.1.index.LICENSE.txt:

